acks until it is cancelled, finished or released."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Nothing is tracked until this is called. Call it as the app launches, such as in its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"application delegate’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"application(_:didFinishLaunchingWithOptions:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and keep what it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"returns:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["lifecycle = tracker.trackLifecycle()"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"As it starts, it compares "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"version"},{"type":"text","text":" with the one "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"versionStore"},{"type":"text","text":" saved: none tracks an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"install, another an update, the same neither; it then saves "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"version"},{"type":"text","text":". Then it tracks an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"open, not from the background. After that, each transition tracks once, however many times"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it is reported:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"iOS, iPadOS, tvOS, visionOS and Mac Catalyst: ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UIApplication"},{"text":"’s notifications. Entering","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the background tracks ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationBackgrounded"},{"text":", returning to the foreground","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationOpened"},{"text":" from the background, and terminating ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationTerminated"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A scene-based app gets them once for the whole app, not per scene.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"watchOS: "},{"code":"WKApplication","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"‘s, without termination, which watchOS doesn’t report."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"macOS: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSApplication"},{"type":"text","text":"’s. Another app becoming active counts as the background, this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one becoming active again as the foreground."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Linux: no notifications; "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/LifecycleObservation\/finish()","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" tracks the termination."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Leaving the foreground, it also makes the tracker’s records durable: it waits for the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracker’s worker to write every record tracked so far to the tracker’s store, then calls","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the store’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"synchronize()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". A delivery batched with ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/LifecycleBatchStrategy","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" sends what","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is pending as it reads the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationBackgrounded","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" record. A notification’s handler only","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"hands the transition on; the tracking, the version store and the store’s work run on a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"task of their own, never on the thread that posted it. Where the system suspends an app in the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"background (all but macOS and Mac Catalyst), the handler asks it for background time","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"code":"ProcessInfo.performExpiringActivity","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), held until the records are durable. A termination’s records are made durable the same way, without","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"holding the main thread up: what the process doesn’t finish before it exits is what the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracker’s documented loss window takes.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It keeps no state outside what it returns. Two calls observe twice, so call it once per"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracker."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Tracks the app’s lifecycle through this tracker until the observation it returns is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"cancelled, finished or released: ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationInstalled","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationUpdated","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationOpened","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" as it starts, then ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationBackgrounded","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationOpened","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" again and ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationTerminated","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" as the app moves.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/Trackers\/Tracker\/trackLifecycle(kinds:version:versionStore:notificationCenter:file:fileID:function:line:column:)"},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"LifecycleTracking","relatedModules":["Trackers"]}],"symbolKind":"method","role":"symbol","remoteSource":{"fileName":"Tracker+TrackLifecycle.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/LifecycleTracking\/Tracker+TrackLifecycle.swift#L63"},"externalID":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV17LifecycleTrackingE05trackC05kinds7version0G5Store18notificationCenter4file0K2ID8function4line6columnAD0C11ObservationVShyAP4KindOG_SSSgx20FoundationEssentials012NotificationJ0CS3SS2itAD07VersionH0RzlF","extendedModule":"Trackers","title":"trackLifecycle(kinds:version:versionStore:notificationCenter:file:fileID:function:line:column:)","roleHeading":"Instance Method","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"trackLifecycle","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"kinds","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","text":"Set","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:17LifecycleTracking0A11ObservationV","text":"LifecycleObservation","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:17LifecycleTracking0A11Obse